Hello,

The next Buildroot Developers meeting will take place on February 4, 5
and 6 in Brussels, right after the FOSDEM conference.

You'll notice that we switched to a 3-day format instead of the usual
2-day format. Attending the full event is not mandatory: if you can
only join for 1 day or 2 days, you are also welcome.

As usual, we will be hosted by Google, our sponsor for many years,
providing an excellent meeting room in the center of Brussels.

Registration is free, just write your name on the Wiki page:

  https://elinux.org/Buildroot:DeveloperDaysFOSDEM2019

If you are interested in participating and are a regular Buildroot
contributor but have issues with the travel costs, please contact me
privately. We do have some (limited) budget for travel expenses if that
allows regular contributors to participate to the meeting.

Best regards,

